Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Wire the footer newsletter form to Shopify customers
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The "Únete al clan" form had no <form>, no submit handler and no
backend — submitting it silently did nothing with the visitor's
email. It now posts to /api/newsletter, which calls Shopify's Admin
API customerCreate with emailMarketingConsent (SHOPIFY_ADMIN_API_TOKEN,
separate from the Storefront token the checkout uses). An email that
already exists is treated as success rather than surfaced as an
error. Until the admin token is set, the form renders disabled with
a "Muy pronto" note — same gating pattern as checkout.
